        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milburn Stone, Norman Macdonnell, John Meston, Don \"Red\" Barry, Lynn Merrick, Bob McKenzie, Karl Hackett, Rex Lease\n- Works: Gunsmoke, Death Valley Outlaws\n- Roles: Doc, Dr. Galen Adams\n\nFacts:\n- Hugh Milburn Stone was born on July 5, 1904, and died on June 12, 1980.\n- Hugh Milburn Stone, sometimes known as Milly Stone, was an American film and television actor.\n- Gunsmoke is an American radio and television Western drama series created by director Norman Macdonnell and writer John Meston.\n- Hugh Milburn Stone was best known for playing Doc, Dr. Galen Adams, on the CBS western series Gunsmoke.\n- Death Valley Outlaws stars Don \"Red\" Barry, Lynn Merrick, Milburn Stone, Bob McKenzie, Karl Hackett, and Rex Lease.",
